To support recurring schedules like 9–5 daily as well as one-off windows, we can use a maintenance_type field:

1. Periodic (e.g., 9–5 every day):

JSON
{
  "url": "https://api.company.com/health",
  "module": "http_2xx",
  "maintenance_enabled": true,
  "maintenance_type": "periodic",
  "maintenance_days": ["*"],
  "maintenance_start": "09:00",
  "maintenance_end": "17:00",
  "maintenance_tz": "America/New_York"
}
(We can specify ["*"] for every day, or specific days like ["Monday", "Tuesday"])

2. One-Time (Fixed window):

JSON
{
  "url": "https://api.company.com/health",
  "module": "http_2xx",
  "maintenance_enabled": true,
  "maintenance_type": "one_time",
  "maintenance_start": "2026-10-05T02:00:00Z",
  "maintenance_end": "2026-10-05T04:00:00Z",
  "maintenance_tz": "UTC"
}
